BT 1 0 0 1 0 63.5 Tm /F1 9 Tf 14.5 TL 1.06653 Tw (The deployment constraint is a C compiler and integer arithmetic \227 nothing else. Neural networks require matrix) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.302031 Tw (multiplication in floating-point or dedicated quantization runtimes \(TFLite, ONNX RT\) that add hundreds of KB of) Tj T* 0 Tw .118446 Tw (dependency. A pruned decision tree ensemble compiles to a nested if-else structure in ~4 KB of C \227 fully auditable,) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.073248 Tw (branch-predictable, and cache-resident on any modern MCU. Every inference path can be traced and verified) Tj T* 0 Tw (statically.) Tj T* ET
