BT 1 0 0 1 0 63.5 Tm /F1 9 Tf 14.5 TL .002605 Tw (Training begins with 300 trees. Post-training pruning identifies the minimal sub-ensemble that preserves accuracy on) Tj T* 0 Tw .262308 Tw (the validation set within tolerance. The result is 5 trees \227 small enough to fit in L1 cache on most embedded cores,) Tj T* 0 Tw .535231 Tw (large enough to provide majority-vote stability \(3-of-5 decision boundary\). Adding more trees past this point yielded) Tj T* 0 Tw .201031 Tw (no measurable accuracy gain on held-out data, confirming the ensemble has reached the bias-variance optimum for) Tj T* 0 Tw (this feature space.) Tj T* ET
