BT 1 0 0 1 0 63.5 Tm /F1 9 Tf 14.5 TL 1.351421 Tw (Raw syscall sequences are variable-length strings \227 unusable directly for fixed-size classifiers. The engineering) Tj T* 0 Tw .00003 Tw (decision is to project any sequence, regardless of length, onto a fixed 32-dimensional space of normalized frequency) Tj T* 0 Tw .626655 Tw (ratios and statistical aggregates. This projection is the core of what makes the model length-invariant \(explained in) Tj T* 0 Tw .531557 Tw (Section 05\). The 32-dimensional size is the result of iterative feature selection: it is the smallest dimensionality that) Tj T* 0 Tw (retains the inter-class separability needed for the accuracy targets.) Tj T* ET
